# Mercure Hub - Production Environment
# Used with: Caddyfile (prod direct, TLS terminating). For load-balancer-fronted
# deploys, layer your own Caddyfiles + env template on top of this image
# downstream.
#
# REQUIRED: All empty values MUST be set during deployment
# Mercure will fail to start without valid JWT configuration

# === Secrets (REQUIRED - set in deployment) ===
# JWT algorithm defaults to HS256 if not specified
MERCURE_PUBLISHER_JWT_KEY=""
MERCURE_SUBSCRIBER_JWT_KEY=""

# === Server ===
SERVER_NAME=""

# Hub identifier — surfaces in per-hub health endpoint paths and metrics labels.
# Customize per deployment (e.g., mercure-prod-us-east, mercure-prod-eu-west).
MERCURE_HUB_NAME=mercure-prod

# === Mercure Directives ===
# Defaults used: heartbeat 40s, write_timeout 600s (don't declare defaults)
#
# === Transport Selection ===
# The "transport" directive inside MERCURE_EXTRA_DIRECTIVES controls which
# backend the hub uses. Swap by replacing the transport block.
# If no transport is specified, the hub defaults to bolt.
#
# Available transports:
#   bolt  — BoltDB, persistent, single-node (default for production)
#   local — in-memory, no persistence (NOT recommended for production)
#   redis — Redis Streams, persistent, multi-node
MERCURE_EXTRA_DIRECTIVES="
cors_origins
publish_origins
transport bolt {
    path ./data/bolt.db
}"
# To switch to redis transport, replace the transport block above with:
#   transport redis {
#       url redis://your-redis-host:6379
#       stream mercure
#       max_length 100000
#       encoding json
#       event_ttl 72h
#       cleanup_interval 5m
#   }
#
# To use JWKS instead of publisher_jwt/subscriber_jwt, add these
# directives inside MERCURE_EXTRA_DIRECTIVES above:
#   publisher_jwks_url https://your-auth-server/.well-known/jwks.json
#   subscriber_jwks_url https://your-auth-server/.well-known/jwks.json
# JWKS takes precedence over publisher_jwt if both are configured.

# === Caddy Global Options ===
GLOBAL_OPTIONS=""

# === Caddy Server Directives ===
CADDY_EXTRA_CONFIG=""
CADDY_SERVER_EXTRA_DIRECTIVES=""